sw-global-war-republic = Republic
sw-global-war-empire = Empire
sw-global-war-politics-denied = This action is unavailable. Refresh the information and check your authority.
sw-global-war-politics-war-unavailable = The current head may declare war after 20 minutes of active round time.
sw-global-war-politics-insufficient-funds = The available treasury balance is insufficient.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-assignment = Your appointment changed. Close the console and open it again.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-head = Only the current head of state can make this decision.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-faction = This console belongs to the other side. Use your own government's console.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-ending = The campaign is ending. Political decisions are no longer accepted.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-capitulating = A surrender is under way. Until it ends, only the surrender confirmation is available.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-changed = Relations between the sides already changed. Review the current state and decide again.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-not-war = A truce can only be offered during war.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-not-truce = Only an active truce can be broken.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-no-truce-offer = Your side has not offered a truce, so there is nothing to withdraw.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-border-not-peace = A border conflict can only be opened in peacetime.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-border-no-claim = No rival accession claim exists in this sector. Wait until the enemy makes one.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-border-own-claim = The claim in this sector is your own side's. There is nothing to contest.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-sponsor-no-civil-war = There is no civil war in this sector. There is no one to fund.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-sponsor-closed = The funding period for neutral sectors has ended.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-amount = Enter an amount above zero.
sw-global-war-politics-denied-surrender-closed = Campaign time has expired. Surrender is no longer possible.
sw-global-war-sanction-imposed = The { $faction } bans exports of { $commodity } to the opposing side.
sw-global-war-sanction-lifted = The { $faction } lifts its export ban on { $commodity } to the opposing side.
sw-global-war-border-conflict = The { $faction } opens a border conflict in { $sector }.
sw-global-war-official-address = Official address. { $faction }, { $author }: { $message }
sw-global-war-surrender-started = The { $faction } confirms its surrender. Territory transfer will finish in 300 seconds.
sw-global-war-war-declared = War has been declared between the Republic and the Empire.
sw-global-war-truce-started = Both sides agreed to a truce. Border conflicts are closed; forces have 120 seconds to withdraw.
sw-global-war-peace-started = The Republic and the Empire are at peace.
sw-global-war-neutral-claim = Accession to the { $faction } begins in { $sector }. The claim may be contested.
sw-global-war-neutral-integrated = { $sector } has joined the { $faction }.
sw-global-war-outcome-republic = Republic victory: the Empire controls no orbits or surfaces.
sw-global-war-outcome-empire = Empire victory: the Republic controls no orbits or surfaces.
sw-global-war-outcome-mutual = Mutual surrender. The campaign ends in a draw.
sw-global-war-outcome-participants = The campaign ended because a side had no connected participants. No military victory is awarded.
sw-global-war-limit-warning = { $minutes } min until the campaign ends. The side holding more orbits and surfaces wins. Now: Republic { $republic }, Empire { $empire }.
sw-global-war-outcome-limit-republic = Campaign time has expired. The Republic wins on orbits and surfaces: { $republic } to { $empire }.
sw-global-war-outcome-limit-empire = Campaign time has expired. The Empire wins on orbits and surfaces: { $empire } to { $republic }.
sw-global-war-outcome-time = Campaign time has expired. The war is not over: neither side took every world from the enemy.
sw-global-war-trade-unavailable = This trade operation is unavailable.
sw-global-war-trade-blockade = External trade is blocked by split orbit and surface ownership.
sw-global-war-trade-war = Trade between opposing sides is suspended during war.
sw-global-war-trade-sanction = A sanction prohibits exporting this commodity.
